config MINIMED_PREDICTOR
    bool "MiniMed 30-minute glucose forecast"
    depends on MINIMED_SAKE
    default y
    help
      Forecast glucose 30 minutes ahead from the pump's readings, insulin and meals, and send it
      to the watchface. Total IOB does not depend on it.

config MINIMED_HYPO
    bool "MiniMed hypo (treat-or-wait) model"
    depends on MINIMED_PREDICTOR
    default y
    help
      Score a falling low on whether to treat it, show the result on the watchface and pop up an
      alert past the treat threshold. Reads the forecast's 4-hour window. About 20 KB of flash,
      most of it model weights.

config MINIMED_GRAPH_MAX_HOURS
    int "MiniMed graph history kept, in hours"
    depends on MINIMED_SAKE
    range 1 24
    default 24
    help
      Hours of BG history kept for the watchface graph. A watchface may ask for up to 24; one that
      asks for more than this gets this much. The graph and the outgoing message buffer together
      take about 100 B of RAM per hour.
